{
  "id": "ch02_s12_yeting",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "adi",
    "songhuizhen"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "主角亲历曝光后仍不能以相似受伤索取阿荻谅解",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "宋将一碗温水挪到席边。阿荻在灯下缝自己的针包。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l2",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "水在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我坐一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l4",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "别坐线。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l5",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你低头把那根线挑开，坐到另一边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l6",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_advance": true
      },
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "九件钱都数过了。补栏延后的话，我也听见了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.adi_pay_original": true
      },
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "余三件方才送来，我数过了。九件齐了，领凭在这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l8",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她点了点针包下面的窄纸，没有递过来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l9",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日她们把沈衡给我的信读了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l10",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我没去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l11",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她叫停了，前头那些却已经——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l12",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不必念给我听。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l13",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我不是想念。我想叫她说……）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l14",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你伸向水碗的手停了一下。宋把碗留在原处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l15",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我才知道那一刻，旁人都听着，自己却插不进一句话。昨晚你也是——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l16",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "昨晚是昨晚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l17",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "碗要凉了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l18",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "钱到了，我认。你补了什么，也照实记。可你今日难受，不能来要我说不怪你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l19",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "是。我方才在等这句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l20",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我不说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l21",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "阿荻咬断线，把针插回包沿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l22",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的私话，我不再借了。先前那份还要追清。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l23",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "追清再告诉我。别替我答好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l24",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今晚还有事？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l25",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还要核原封与调令。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l26",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "喝完去。我陪她坐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l27",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你喝完温水，把碗放回她够得着的地方。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l28",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "灯留下。针眼还没穿好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s12_yeting.l29",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你走出门，屋里的灯没有跟来。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch02_s13_hanyuan"
}
